    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><div><div><p>You have honed your proficiency with particular tools, granting you the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with one tool of your choice.</p></li><li><p>Choose one tool with which you have proficiency. Your proficiency bonus is doubled for any ability check you make with it. The tool you choose must be one that isn’t already benefiting from a feature that doubles your proficiency bonus.</p></li></ul></div></div></div>",
